1. `tests/fixtures/legacy-collection-output/producer.rs`: separate old nonfinal producer and optional isolated old RED entry; local public setup/finite driver and closed handoff writer.
2. `tests/integration/workflow-primitives/legacy_collection_output_view.rs`: separate exact ignored consumer, receipt parser, pre/post witnesses and normal compensation driver.
